    "Converts an earthwork volume measured in one soil state to another by a soil conversion factor, V2=V1×factor. Using the loosening coefficient L (typically around 1.1-1.3) converts bank volume to loose (excavated) volume, while using the compaction coefficient C (typically around 0.85-0.95) converts bank volume to compacted volume.": "Converts an earthwork volume measured in one soil state to another by a soil conversion factor, V2=V1×factor. Using the loosening coefficient L (typically around 1.1-1.3) converts bank volume to loose (excavated) volume, while using the compaction coefficient C (typically around 0.85-0.95) converts bank volume to compacted volume.",
    "Converts optical power in milliwatts to the logarithmic dBm scale, P(dBm) = 10*log10(P_mW), the standard absolute power unit used throughout fiber-optic and telecom systems.": "Converts optical power in milliwatts to the logarithmic dBm scale, P(dBm) = 10*log10(P_mW), the standard absolute power unit used throughout fiber-optic and telecom systems.",
