    "Dry matter content": "Dry matter content",
    "Dry matter percentage varies widely with crop, maturity, and moisture at cutting, so it should be measured or sampled rather than assumed. Fresh weight and dry matter yield share the same mass unit.": "Dry matter percentage varies widely with crop, maturity, and moisture at cutting, so it should be measured or sampled rather than assumed. Fresh weight and dry matter yield share the same mass unit.",
    "E = R·(sec(Δ/2) − 1); Δ is entered in degrees.": "E = R·(sec(Δ/2) − 1); Δ is entered in degrees.",
    "EC50 is the concentration giving half-maximal effect, and the Hill coefficient n controls curve steepness (n=1 gives simple hyperbolic saturation). Assumes a single-site, reversible receptor-binding model.": "EC50 is the concentration giving half-maximal effect, and the Hill coefficient n controls curve steepness (n=1 gives simple hyperbolic saturation). Assumes a single-site, reversible receptor-binding model.",
    "Each meiosis halves the expected fraction of shared alleles inherited by descent. For relatives connected by multiple paths (e.g. full siblings), sum the coefficient over each separate path.": "Each meiosis halves the expected fraction of shared alleles inherited by descent. For relatives connected by multiple paths (e.g. full siblings), sum the coefficient over each separate path.",
    "Earthwork Volume Conversion by Soil Factor": "Earthwork Volume Conversion by Soil Factor",
