    "The angle is entered in degrees and converted internally to radians. VMG is at its maximum (equal to speed) when angle is 0 and drops to zero at 90 degrees off course.": "The angle is entered in degrees and converted internally to radians. VMG is at its maximum (equal to speed) when angle is 0 and drops to zero at 90 degrees off course.",
    "The bearing angle θ is entered in degrees, measured from the reference (usually north) meridian, and converted internally to radians. The sign convention for the bearing must be applied consistently when summing a full traverse.": "The bearing angle θ is entered in degrees, measured from the reference (usually north) meridian, and converted internally to radians. The sign convention for the bearing must be applied consistently when summing a full traverse.",
    "The bearing capacity factors Nc, Nq and Nγ depend only on the soil friction angle φ and must be looked up from a Terzaghi table or chart for the given φ before entering them here. Assumes a strip footing under general shear failure on a homogeneous soil.": "The bearing capacity factors Nc, Nq and Nγ depend only on the soil friction angle φ and must be looked up from a Terzaghi table or chart for the given φ before entering them here. Assumes a strip footing under general shear failure on a homogeneous soil.",
    "The classic doubling period is about 2 years, though some formulations use 18 months or other values. t and T must use the same time unit.": "The classic doubling period is about 2 years, though some formulations use 18 months or other values. t and T must use the same time unit.",
    "The constant 101.3 converts knots to feet per minute (1 kt ≈ 101.3 ft/min) under the small-angle assumption that sink rate equals horizontal speed divided by L/D. A higher L/D or lower airspeed gives a shallower descent.": "The constant 101.3 converts knots to feet per minute (1 kt ≈ 101.3 ft/min) under the small-angle assumption that sink rate equals horizontal speed divided by L/D. A higher L/D or lower airspeed gives a shallower descent.",
    "The constant k depends on local crustal velocity structure and is commonly taken near 8 km/s, though regional values vary from about 7 to 9. ts and tp must be in seconds.": "The constant k depends on local crustal velocity structure and is commonly taken near 8 km/s, though regional values vary from about 7 to 9. ts and tp must be in seconds.",
    "The four probabilities must sum to 1 and each must be strictly positive, since log2(0) is undefined. Joint entropy is maximized at 2 bits when all four outcomes are equally likely (0.25 each).": "The four probabilities must sum to 1 and each must be strictly positive, since log2(0) is undefined. Joint entropy is maximized at 2 bits when all four outcomes are equally likely (0.25 each).",
    "The mole fraction is dimensionless and must be between 0 and 1; the result carries the same pressure unit as the total pressure entered.": "The mole fraction is dimensionless and must be between 0 and 1; the result carries the same pressure unit as the total pressure entered.",
    "The remainder (100 minus labor share) approximates the share going to capital and profit. LC and VA must be measured over the same period and in the same currency.": "The remainder (100 minus labor share) approximates the share going to capital and profit. LC and VA must be measured over the same period and in the same currency.",
    "The speed of sound in seawater is typically near 1500 m/s but varies with temperature, salinity, and pressure. t is the full round-trip (down and back) travel time in seconds.": "The speed of sound in seawater is typically near 1500 m/s but varies with temperature, salinity, and pressure. t is the full round-trip (down and back) travel time in seconds.",
    "This ignores operating expenses, vacancy, and financing costs; use net rental yield for a more complete picture. Income and price must be in the same currency.": "This ignores operating expenses, vacancy, and financing costs; use net rental yield for a more complete picture. Income and price must be in the same currency.",
    "This is the same relationship as Shortt's formula (minimum spiral length), rearranged so that R drops out. It is a quick way to check the minimum clothoid parameter for a given design speed before a specific radius has been chosen.": "This is the same relationship as Shortt's formula (minimum spiral length), rearranged so that R drops out. It is a quick way to check the minimum clothoid parameter for a given design speed before a specific radius has been chosen.",
