    "Tin and Tout must use the same temperature scale so their difference is a valid interval; eta lumps together turbine, generator, and thermodynamic-cycle losses. Typical binary-cycle geothermal conversion efficiencies are roughly 0.10-0.15.": "Tin and Tout must use the same temperature scale so their difference is a valid interval; eta lumps together turbine, generator, and thermodynamic-cycle losses. Typical binary-cycle geothermal conversion efficiencies are roughly 0.10-0.15.",
